{"id":"NCT04005976","title":"Montalcino Aortic Consortium: Precision Medicine for Heritable Thoracic Aortic Disease","official":"Montalcino Aortic Consortium: Precision Medicine for Heritable Thoracic Aortic Disease","summary":"The Montalcino Aortic Consortium (MAC) will provide the infrastructure to assemble large cohorts of patients with mutations in known heritable thoracic aortic disease (H-TAD) genes, define the phenotype associated with these genes, and determine genetic and environmental modifiers of H-TAD.","conditions":["Aortic Aneurysm","Aortic Dissection","Aortic Diseases"],"interventions":[],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Patients and their relatives with a confirmed pathogenic, likely pathogenic variant, or variant of unknown clinical significance in at least one of the H-TAD genes (i.e. TGFBR1, TGFBR2, SMAD3, TGFB2, TGFB3, ACTA2, MYH11, MYLK, PRKG1, MAT2A, MFAP5, LOX, COL3A1, FOXE3, and FBN1).\n* Patients of all ages, sex and race for which informed consent can be obtained.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Patients without a confirmed causative variant for H-TAD.","minAge":"","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":true,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":5000,"start":"2016-06-15","pcd":"2037-01-01","upd":"2026-02-02","sponsor":"The University of Texas Health Science Center, Houston","areas":["other"],"central":["Dianna M Milewicz, MD, PhD · 713-500-6725 · Dianna.M.Milewicz@uth.tmc.edu","Ernesto Calderon Martinez, MD · (713) 500-6715 · Ernesto.CalderonMartinez@uth.tmc.edu"],"sites":[{"f":"HOAG memorial hospital presbyterian","city":"Newport Beach","pr":"California","zip":"92663","s":"R","lat":33.6189,"lon":-117.929,"c":"Site Investigator · 949-650-3350"},{"f":"Hoag Memorial Hospital Presbyterian","city":"Newport Beach","pr":"California","zip":"92663","s":"R","lat":33.6189,"lon":-117.929,"c":"Chelsey Torres, MD · Chelsey.torres@hoag.org"},{"f":"Sutter Health","city":"Sacramento","pr":"California","zip":"95816","s":"R","lat":38.5816,"lon":-1